WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:06,150
You are safe. Thank you.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:08,150
Do you know how to get to Oligar Hotel?

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:10,150
I heard there's a survivor festival there

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,150
I want to take my daughter to try my luck

5
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:14,150
I am the leader of Oligar

6
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,180
you can join

7
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,340
I'll take you there. Thank you.

8
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:22,060
thank you very much

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:29,660
sleep home

10
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:32,080
I was actually sent back by her once today

11
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:35,660
But why am I the only one who still has a vague impression?

12
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:40,510
As for getting used to it, what does it mean to be steady?

13
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,670
Not far away
